==English==

===Etymology===
From [[Greek]] [[μεσολιθικός]] (''mesolithikos''), from [[Ancient Greek]] prefix [[μεσο-]]
"[[meso-]]", from [[μέσος]] (''mesos'') "middle" + [[λίθος]] (''lithos'') "stone".

